  "description": "Time travel that messed everything up.\nAfter discovering a mystery incense stick, Seol-A finds out that she can travel back in time by lighting the incense stick. With her new ability, Seol-A saves her mother and thinks she's finally found her happy ending. However, she realizes that her time-traveling ability comes with a price when she finds out that her first love I-Jun is now dating her best friend...\n\n(Source: Manta, edited)\n\n*Note: This work is inspired by the K-Drama \"Nine: Nine Time Travels\".*",
